      "C8": "Solid on 带; cited folk oral mnemonic literature and 11-segment line count.",
      "C9": "Vigilant fact-checker; called out misattributions in Round 3, proved 噩 has 11 horizontals.",
      "C10": "Primary philological authority; cited authentic riddle canon for 噩 vs. 带, proved lack of waist verticals in 噩.",
      "C11": "Structural anchor; detailed 3-tier mapping and mathematical inconsistency of lattice theory."
    },
